   "body": "Correction from the #758 review (Fable High, fixed in 4173c455): `W440c` **does** refresh, to the MP thread after 3 s (`<meta http-equiv=\"Refresh\" content=\"3; url=/forum2.php?config=hfr.inc&cat=prive&post=…\">`). The \"no link, no input and no `Refresh`\" in the description above is wrong on the refresh. It is `unrecognized` because it has no link or input (so not a refusal) and no \"avec succès\" (so not a success). A rule for this issue cannot rely on a \"refresh-less\" shape; classify the sentence, or a link-less `.hop` without \"avec succès\" after a write, citing `W440c`.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
